        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kandi ndio, lwa mugeni woosi, utaveeye mulala ku vandu vovo Isiraeli, yaazaa kutura mu kivala chi hale kigira lieta liilio linene, nu mukono gugwo gwi zinguru, mukono gugwo gwa nyirika, lwa yaazaa nu kusaala nivahenzi ku Litembeli yili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "huliliza kutura mwigulu ho vomenyo vuvwo, ma okole goosi kolondekana na agumugeni akusaala umukole; kuduuka avandu vosi avaveeye mu lirova vaduuki kumanya lieta liilio nu kutia ivi, kuli vandu va Isiraeli vaatia nu kuhulira. Na ndio, vandu yava vaduuki kumanya ndi, Litembeli yili iliamali kwumbaka lilangangwa ku lieta liilio",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Niiva avandu vovo valatura kuzia kulwaana avasigu vaavo, kunzira yoosi yavatumira ku, ma vasaale ku ivi nivahenzi ku lidaala linene yili lia watovola ma kandi Litembeli yili iliamali kwumbaka kigira lieta liilio, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku, hulira lisaala liavo kutura mwigulu ma uvahe uvuguuti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
