            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lwa vandu vovo vakolera ivi uvwoni, na havulaho nu mundu okolaa uvwoni, ma mu vutima vuvwo oleka avasigu vaavo vavaguuti nu kuvavugula kuvahila mu kivala kindi kuli avahambe, kali niiva kivala chene yiki keveeye ihale ligali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hulira lisaala lia vandu vovo. Niiva valiganira nu kusaala ku ivi mu kivala chene yicho, nokovoora zimbi ziavo ku ivi, hulira lisaala liavo, O, Yahova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niiva valiganira nu mwoyo mulala na roho mulala mu kivala chavo chu vuhambe, ma vasaale ni vahenzi ku kivala chavo, cha ivi waha avaguuga vaavo, lidaala linene lia ivi watovola, kandi Litembeli lia inzi ndumbaka kigira lieta liilio, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku, hulira lisaala liavo kutura mwigulu ho vomenyo vuvwo, ma uvahe uvuguuti kandi usamihi avandu vovo avamala kwonera ivi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
