            "verseId": "2CH.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kalunu, O, Nyasaye wange, ngogonya ohenze avandu vovo kandi huliriza lisaala lihaanangwa havundu hano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalunu singira, O, Yahova Nyasaye, kandi harara ni Lisandugu lie Lilagana liilio, liveeye kelolero chi zinguru zizio, ma wingiri mu Litembeli ma omenye mu mihiga ni mihiga. Gasiza avasaalisi vovo ku goosi ga vakora, kandi yaanza avandu vovo vosi vave nu vusangali kigira uvulahi vuvwo kuvo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O, Yahova Nyasaye, utasula mwami wa umali kotovola. Wizulizi uvuyanzi vwa waali navwo ku mutumikiri woovo Daudi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
